  (text "DIGIDASH MAIN BOARD, REV 2  -  docs/hardware/digidash_rev2_plan.md" (at 20 15 0) (effects (font (size 5 5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a93668c3-090f-5f94-9c2c-925d6f1447d6"))
  (text "All SMD except connectors. The sensor pack is a slot card (SensorCard/, CAN node 0x04); J27 takes its optional sensor-frame serial line (a jumper wire) and fans it out to the three screens. TVP5150AM1 on the board. Six 2x15 card slots (cards stand on edge), four cable ports, a trunk port, and an AUX 12 V path for the slots." (at 20 26 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "01c40d47-a43d-53ac-bed4-94f0c8166afa"))
  (text "POWER: J7 (battery, ignition, illumination), reverse protection, TVS, 5 A buck (TI TPS54560B typical application, 400 kHz), 3.3 V and 1.8 V LDOs, switched 12 V" (at 20 45 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "86b750c6-3ce2-5631-933a-3b142f96f299"))
