  (text "SLOTS: six 2x15 sockets J31-J36 (slot 1-6), cards stand on edge (docs/hardware/accessory_ports.md). Per slot: fused 5 V, switched 12 V, 3.3 V, constant 12 V, an ID resistor. Shared: CAN, WAKE, LAMP / REV levels, the analog audio bus, AUX 12 V, and the I2S rail (BCK, WS, MIC, RET, MCLK: bused to all six slots, the audio card is the clock master)." (at 1220 246.5 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4c02dde3-fb4f-5de7-8301-ac3e3e2a6a7e"))
